+
+    def test_the_pass_budget_is_one_cap_for_the_whole_run(self) -> None:
+        """`[driver].max_passes` bounds the RUN, not each wave in turn — otherwise every
+        adopted wave silently multiplies the operator's budget. The parent's wave spends
+        2 passes (build → iterate-plan → re-plan → split → accept) and 601's spends 1, so
+        a budget of 3 is exhausted before 602's wave: it is left PLANNED and NAMED, never
+        driven on borrowed budget. One more pass and the same run finishes it."""
